  "question": {
    "text": "Let $A=\\{1,2,3, \\ldots, 10\\}$ and $B=\\left\\{\\frac{m}{n}: m, n \\in A, m \\lt n\\right.$ and $\\left.\\operatorname{gcd}(m, n)=1\\right\\}$. Then $n(B)$ is equal to :",
    "image": null
  },
